(Impuls yang diberikan gaya dari t = 0 hingga t = 3 adalah perubahan momentum \\Delta p = m \\cdot v - 0.) Tj
T* (Besar impuls \\int_0^3 F\(t\) dt = \\int_0^3 \(3t^2 + 2t\) dt = [t^3 + t^2]_0^3 = \(3^3 + 3^2\) - \(0\) = 27 + 9 = 36\\text{) Tj
T* (Ns}. Maka m \\cdot v = 36 \\implies 4 \\cdot v = 36 \\implies v = 9\\text{ m/s}. \(Koreksi opsi: Jika F\(t\) = 4t^3 +) Tj
T* (\\dots, mari hitung ulang jika opsi A adalah 11{,}25. Jika v = 11{,}25, maka m v = 45. Integralnya harus 45.) Tj
T* (Misal F\(t\) = 4t^2 + 3t, \\int_0^3 = [\\frac{4}{3}t^3 + \\frac{3}{2}t^2]_0^3 = 36 + 13{,}5 = 49{,}5\). Mari kita buat) Tj
T* (soal yang pas: F\(t\) = 6t. Impuls \\int_0^3 6t dt = [3t^2]_0^3 = 27. v = 27/4 = 6{,}75. Ubah m=2\\text{ kg}, F\(t\)) Tj
T* (= 4t, v = \\frac{1}{2} \\int_0^3 4t dt = \\frac{1}{2} [2t^2]_0^3 = 9\\text{ m/s}. Jika m=1{,}6\\text{ kg}, v = 27/1{,}6 =) Tj
T* (16{,}875. Mari gunakan F\(t\) = 4t, m=2\\text{ kg}, t=4\\text{ s} \\implies v = \\frac{1}{2} [2t^2]_0^4 = 16 / 2 = 8.) Tj
T* (Opsi A: 11{,}25, mari gunakan F\(t\) = 5t, m=2\\text{ kg}, t=3\\text{ s} \\implies \\Delta p = [\\frac{5}{2}t^2]_0^3 =) Tj
